 at\r<br>&gt; <a href=\"http://www.noamross.net/davis-r-users-group.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.noamross.net/davis-r-users-group.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467741157000&amp;usg=AOvVaw19Fr6-cjoEci_DhyidsoWp\">http://www.noamross.net/davis-r-users-group.html</a>\r<br>&gt; ---\r<br>&gt; You received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups\r<br>&gt; &quot;Davis R Users&#39; Group&quot; group.\r<br>&gt; To unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an\r<br>&gt; email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">davis-rug+...@googlegroups.com</a>.\r<br>&gt; Visit this group at <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467741157000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ybhT7kZhPA2aogWSaaXI-\">http://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug</a>.\r<br>&gt; For more options, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/optout\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/optout&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467741157000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0cwh_tseqrrMGvRz0lytQl\">https://groups.google.com/d/optout</a>.\r<br>"
